+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------- font bindings (FACE CHECK 7)
+/** FACE CHECK 7 (font-binding; the chair p9): every place a FAMILY NAME is bound to bytes — each
+ *  `@font-face` (family + src) in every CSS language, and each `new FontFace(family, source)` in
+ *  code (the family folded through concatenation and consts; a non-literal family is UNRESOLVED).
